  "contentHtml": "<p>&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 &#39;협업&#39;을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</p><p>수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&#160;</p><p><b>** &#39;말머리&#39; 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&#160;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>#정전기 #마찰전기 #대전&#160;</b><b>#LED #발광다이오드 #전류</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>동아출판 교과서에 있는 실험인데, 최근에 우연찮게 더 좋은 재료를 발견했습니다.</p><p>예전에는 테프론 테이프를 지우개에 감아서 하는 방식이었는데,</p><p>&#160;&quot;테프론 바닥 패드&quot;가 &quot;다*소&quot;에 1000원에 팔더라구요.</p><p>테프론 재질이라서 해봤더니, 잘됐습니다.^^</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvq571oxh5v5ebwveavgx62uo@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"//img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvq571oxh5v5ebwveavgx62uo%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33157603497%26signature%3D5gz30WvUM6FGo9SqVFLy7zHd938%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvq571oxh5v5ebwveavgx62uo?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cTU3MW94aDV2NWVid3ZlYXZneDYydW8iLCJ0aWQiOiIwYzVkODBhMC00YTg1LTQwMmMtODY5MC1lZDkwYzZmZDQxMjAiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODI2Mjd9.P59dhCAHvIQie3X6mCD0Ntu4JpoOoxtNMXLRL2Xu7kQ5Wkclu4do4z-FgwdWaG1JPF2qWsK78hVtp56iJAM8JQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ed460084b4a23ef766d84cb1d1bb5abe02cc386\" class=\"txc-image\" data-